  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Sidneyia inexpectans. Compression fossils do not preserve life volume or color. This revision adopts the 2023 interpretation of three post-antennal head-limb pairs and nine trunk-limb pairs; the strongest direct new head evidence is from S. minor, supported by reinterpretation of S. inexpectans specimens. Abdominal counts of two and three remain published alternatives: r001 explicitly follows the two-sclerite Burgess Shale interpretation in Zacaï et al. 2016. Exact limb joint and gill-filament counts, shell thickness, soft tissues, posture and palette are simplified or inferred, not fossil-exact.",
    "zh": "西德尼虫的示意性活体复原。采用2023年解释的三对触角后头肢和九对躯干肢；新增头部证据主要来自另一物种并结合本种材料重释。腹部采用2016年两节解释，仍保留已发表三节替代解释的不确定性；关节、鳃丝、软组织与颜色均作简化。"
  },
